# Tech Stack — Approved Technologies

| Layer | Choice | Avoid |
|-------|--------|-------|
| **Backend** | Laravel 12 + PHP 8.3 | Raw PHP, Symfony (unless needed) |
| **Frontend** | Vue 3 + Inertia.js + TypeScript | React, Angular |
| **UI Components** | Reka UI (shadcn-vue) | Bootstrap |
| **Styling** | Tailwind CSS v4 | Styled-components |
| **State** | Pinia | Vuex |
| **Database** | MySQL 8 + Eloquent | SQLite (prod), raw PDO |
| **Cache** | Redis (Laravel Cache) | Memcached |
| **Queue** | Laravel Queue (Redis driver) | BullMQ (Node-only) |
| **Auth** | Laravel Sanctum + Fortify | Manual JWT |
| **Email** | Resend / SMTP via Laravel Mail | — |
| **Search** | MySQL FULLTEXT → Meilisearch | Elasticsearch |
| **Testing** | PHPUnit + Pest + Playwright | Codeception |
| **CI/CD** | GitHub Actions | Jenkins |
| **Monitoring** | Laravel Telescope (dev) + Sentry (prod) | — |
| **Logging** | Laravel Log (Monolog) | error_log() |
| **Code Style** | Laravel Pint (PHP) + Prettier (JS) | — |

## When to change stack
Before adopting a new library: `composer audit`, check PHP 8.3 compatibility, check Laravel DI support, verify MIT/Apache license.
